        <div class="principle-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-content">
          <h2 class="principle-title">Nol Penjualan Data</h2>
          <p class="principle-desc">Kami tidak pernah menjual, menyewakan, atau memperdagangkan data pribadi pengunjung ke pihak ketiga atau broker periklanan manapun.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="principle-card">
        <div class="principle-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M21 12c0 1.66-4 3-9 3s-9-1.34-9-3"></path><path d="M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-content">
          <h2 class="principle-title">Data Pasar Publik</h2>
          <p class="principle-desc">Dataset emiten BEI dan mutasi KSEI yang dianalisis adalah data keterbukaan informasi publik resmi, bukan data privat individu.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="principle-card">
        <div class="principle-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="4.93" y1="4.93" x2="19.07" y2="19.07"></line></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-content">
          <h2 class="principle-title">Bebas Pelacak Invasif</h2>
          <p class="principle-desc">Tanpa cookie iklan pihak ketiga, tanpa pixel pelacak lintas situs. Penyimpanan lokal hanya untuk preferensi antarmuka pengguna.</p>
        </div>
